      "GHSA-mrhx-c7xc-m3w5|zod": {
        "active": true,
        "notes": "Reviewed 2026-10-23: app and OpenAI SDK require Zod 3.25.76; upstream will not release a v3 fix (colinhacks/zod#6653). scripts/patch-zod-v3.cjs verifies exact registry-source hashes and backports early rejection for oversized bounded arrays/sets, including async and ESM/CJS paths. prepare/build hooks apply it and the security gate verifies zero element-parser calls, one size issue, nested paths, valid inputs and tamper refusal. This matches the bounded-container scope of upstream PR 6652; unbounded schemas still require application input limits. Zod 4 tooling is upgraded to 4.6.7. Do not use unpatched --ignore-scripts installs for application builds. Remove after the separately validated Zod 4/SDK migration; recheck before expiry.",
        "expiry": "2026-11-03"
      }
